# Source for s2-ooz1-s3k-super.txt (InputLogAuthorTool --script). Oil Ocean Act 1 with Sonic 3 &
# Knuckles donating, seven Chaos Emeralds declared and Knuckles following. These are the recorded
# rows 0-4883 of trace s2/ooz (s2-lvl-select-OOZ.bk2 from movie frame 2772, run-length encoded),
# with one change: the jump held from row 4184 is released on row 4200 and pressed again on
# row 4201. The S3K donor's Super rule needs that second press in the air. By then the replay
# has collected 52 rings and the timer reads 1:08, so the transform is legitimate. Rows before
# 4200 replay the recording unchanged, and positions match the trace there.
